header: "---\nname: jake-x-x-thread\ndescription: \"Build an X thread: the first post that sells the whole thing, one idea per post, cut to fit X's weighted character count, and a last post that people act on. Use when the user says \\\"thread\\\", \\\"write a thread\\\", \\\"turn this into a thread\\\", \\\"tweetstorm\\\", or has a list-shaped or step-shaped idea that would be cramped in one post.\"\nlicense: MIT\nmetadata:\n  upstream_repository: Jakeschincariol/x-agent-skill\n  upstream_skill: x-thread\n  upstream_commit: 7822c29b4aedbd400b9339839d3f59f3652b1317\nprompt-source: prompt.toon\n---\n"
